所以看得到師父在煮麵跟熬湯\n環境乾淨明亮衛生\n\n我覺得小高拉麵平價好吃沒什麼可以挑剔的！\n以後還會想再回訪～",null,[0,27]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/7164384572847881560/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjAxVTFaVlVrVlBTR2gyVFcxR1ZWVXdSalJYUjFwMlYxVlNjR015WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/7164384572847881560/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjAxVTFaVlVrVlBTR2gyVFcxR1ZWVXdSalJYUjFwMlYxVlNjR015WXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/7164384572847881560/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjAxVTFaVlVrVlBTR2gyVFcxR1ZWVXdSalJYUjFwMlYxVlNjR015WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/7164384572847881560/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjAxVTFaVlVrVlBTR2gyVFcxR1ZWVXdSalJYUjFwMlYxVlNjR015WXhBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/7164384572847881560/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjAxVTFaVlVrVlBTR2gyVFcxR1ZWVXdSalJYUjFwMlYxVlNjR015WXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/7164384572847881560/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjAxVTFaVlVrVlBTR2gyVFcxR1ZWVXdSalJYUjFwMlYxVlNjR015WXhBQhAA"]],[null,null,2433,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT201U1ZVUkVPSGh2TW1GVVUwRjRXR1p2V1VScGMyYxAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x827fe15ce472d8a5!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOm5SVUREOHhvMmFUU0F4WGZvWURpc2c%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT201U1ZVUkVPSGh2TW1GVVUwRjRXR1p2V1VScGMyYxAB\u0026t\u003d1\u0026entityid\u003dCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT201U1ZVUkVPSGh2TW1GVVUwRjRXR1p2V1VScGMyYxI-Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT201U1ZVUkVPSGh2TW1GVVUwRjRXR1p2V1VScGMyYxILMGRoZlZyNTFzNkEaPgovQ0FJUUFDb2RDaHR5Y0Y5b09tNVNWVVJFT0hodk1tRlVVMEY0V0dadldVUnBjMmMSCzBkaGZWcjUxczZBIhIJAAAAAAAAAAARpdhy5Fzhf4IqCzBkaGZWcjUxczZB\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,nul